    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it sounds like a lot of paperwork though lol. i'm mostly worried about dealing with those \"problematic\" employees who just seem to ignore the rules or act in bad faith regardless of what i say. how do i handle someone who is clearly just being disruptive or malicious in the team?",
